{"id": "1905363", "name": "שייכות לעומת הכלה – ∈ ו-⊆ בקבוצה של קבוצות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q1_SETS_V3_Q4_WIDTH\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">שייכות לעומת הכלה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9;\">\\(\\displaystyle A={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">הקפידו להבחין בין הסימנים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\in\\)</span> ו־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span>.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 110px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; column-gap: 12px; row-gap: 9px; text-align: center; font-size: 16px;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}\\in A\\)<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; max-width: 110px;\">[[input:ans1]][[validation:ans1]]</span>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:2}}\\in A\\)<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; max-width: 110px;\">[[input:ans2]][[validation:ans2]]</span>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:3}}\\in A\\)<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; max-width: 110px;\">[[input:ans3]][[validation:ans3]]</span>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:4}}\\subseteq A\\)<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; max-width: 110px;\">[[input:ans4]][[validation:ans4]]</span>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:5}}\\in A\\)<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; max-width: 110px;\">[[input:ansB1]][[validation:ansB1]]</span>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:5}}\\subseteq A\\)<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; max-width: 110px;\">[[input:ansB2]][[validation:ansB2]]</span>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:6}}\\in A\\)<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; max-width: 110px;\">[[input:ansC1]][[validation:ansC1]]</span>\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:6}}\\subseteq A\\)<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 110px; max-width: 110px;\">[[input:ansC2]][[validation:ansC2]]</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q1_SETS_V3_Q4_WIDTH\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>הסימן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span> אומר ש־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> הוא <strong>איבר</strong> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>, ואילו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\subseteq A\\)</span> אומר שכל איבר של הקבוצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> שייך ל־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</p>\n<p>כאן איברי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> הם המספרים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}},{{CT:7}}\\)</span> ושלוש הקבוצות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}},{{CT:5}},{{CT:4}}\\)</span>. לכן:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\in A\\)</span>, אבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\notin A\\)</span>; הקבוצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}}=\\{{{CT:2}}\\}\\)</span> היא איבר של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>, לא המספר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> עצמו.</li>\n<li><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\notin A\\)</span>. היא מופיעה בתוך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span>, אך שייכות אינה טרנזיטיבית.</li>\n<li><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\nsubseteq A\\)</span>, מפני שלמשל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:8}}\\in D\\)</span> אבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:8}}\\notin A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\in A\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\subseteq A\\)</span>: גם הקבוצה עצמה היא איבר, וגם שני איבריה שייכים ל־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}}\\in A\\)</span> אבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:6}}\\nsubseteq A\\)</span>, משום ש־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\notin A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">\n<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>\n</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ansB1", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwo